SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers only what this port added:

  - the def rewrite: the shared HMM_MaskBase, HMM_PropBase, HMM_CandyBase and
    HMM_MakeCandyBase, the corrected stats, the conditional loading of the
    recipes, and the packaging
  - the French translation
  - the repository documentation

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ORIGINAL MOD. The eleven masks, the eleven decorations
and the six sweets - their artwork, their design and the idea - are the work
of [KD] Killer_Diller, reused here:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2257175849

Killer_Diller never declared a licence for them, so none is granted here and
none can be. They are redistributed under the usual practice for abandoned
mods - explicit credit, a link to the original, and removal on request.

If Killer_Diller asks for this to be taken down, it comes down. Immediately,
and without discussion.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was changed, file by file.
